sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant WM as WorkManager
    participant OS as Android OS
    participant W as SyncWorker

    App->>WM: enqueueUniqueWork("sync", KEEP, constraints=CONNECTED)
    WM->>WM: persist request (DB)
    Note over App: app is killed - request survives
    OS-->>WM: connectivity available
    WM->>W: run doWork (new process if needed)
    W->>W: drain outbox + pull delta (idempotent, Ch 29/31/32)
    alt transient failure
        W-->>WM: Result.retry()
        WM->>WM: reschedule with backoff (Ch 2)
    else done
        W-->>WM: Result.success()
    end
    WM-->>App: WorkInfo (observed by UI)
